  "description": "KA.Barcode Reader for Data Matrix from Excel is a VB.NET barcode scanner library to read, scan Data Matrix barcode from Excel in your ASP.NET Core web and Windows applications.\n\nThis package includes detailed example VB.NET source code to scan, read, decode Data Matrix data message from Excel file in .NET projects.\n\nGuides:\n* How to Guide : https://www.keepautomation.com/guide/vbnet_barcode_reader.html\n* Email : support@keepautomation.com",
